WEBVTT

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.620
nešto o sebi

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.916
i svom umetničkom delu.

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:39.459
HP: (na kineskom)

00:00:39.459 --> 00:00:42.583
JR: Rođen sam i odrastao
blizu Mančestera,

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:43.550
u Engleskoj,

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:47.122
ali neću vam to reći na
engleskom jeziku,

00:00:47.122 --> 00:00:49.883
jer pokušavam da izbegnem
bilo kakvu pretpostavku

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.965
koju bi mogao da stvori
moj severnjački akcenat.

00:00:52.965 --> 00:00:55.540
(Smeh)

00:00:55.540 --> 00:01:04.975
HP: (na kineskom)